{
 "batchId": "b-0171",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_4eb0cbacbeb96ee55923",
   "sourceHash": "4eb0cbacbeb96ee559230341cc3e49114839e3c8adad3afd3919be805a120f3a",
   "text": "香料与草药的运用",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b972568b93ae1f905215",
   "sourceHash": "b972568b93ae1f9052155f1b5ddabfc094ca2396643a005d277e148af19d7f2f",
   "text": "探索体式之外更深层的瑜伽生活方式，学习如何将瑜伽哲学融入现代生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_398baf93867099cc1229",
   "sourceHash": "398baf93867099cc122999b8e8893c772c767d84a3102c78870037a7d0d12663",
   "text": "了解日常与季节作息在阿育吠陀中的重要性，探索日常与季节作息是如何安排的。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_03467414b347207e9e51",
   "sourceHash": "03467414b347207e9e51a5d808920059b277be6d55d919741905ba6cd13a7bba",
   "text": "学习日常生活中必要的阿育吠陀原则。我们经验丰富的医生将为您讲解实用的宜与忌。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1bd39e3cd7abd712eb8c",
   "sourceHash": "1bd39e3cd7abd712eb8c7491104ec3dfd26d1594e0edac641006655368ef2464",
   "text": "练习瑜伽体式（asanas）30–45 分钟。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8adefbcdb8c7d0fe3fad",
   "sourceHash": "8adefbcdb8c7d0fe3fad4de988e7929d22caa1f99e684a72854e03156a56bca9",
   "text": "进行调息（pranayama，呼吸练习）和冥想。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_56e0c16521d1097c969a",
   "sourceHash": "56e0c16521d1097c969a81363c8323efc44cdd04086c82b2f99aa548b6dad81c",
   "text": "享用一杯草本茶或其他饮品。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_056baa1252b1b552d005",
   "sourceHash": "056baa1252b1b552d005f6fd6f49d89067f88296ea1a948936aa0d755847cf75",
   "text": "在自然中散步，或进行轻度身体活动。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce1accbdf82c4011eeef",
   "sourceHash": "ce1accbdf82c4011eeef802cc4650af889a9da2dc1aad5f9f4826243c394b78f",
   "text": "短暂休息放松。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c8848a0c5b68c45f2731",
   "sourceHash": "c8848a0c5b68c45f2731723eccbcf85bd0380b8149bf13aef2074800953ad731",
   "text": "享用一杯草本茶或新鲜果汁。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfc425e62ea36a4b0dad",
   "sourceHash": "bfc425e62ea36a4b0dada31481581eae777e6d0b91d013e50c688f39c370b016",
   "text": "参加一次阿育吠陀疗法，例如 Abhyanga（阿比扬加）或 Udwarthana（乌德瓦塔纳）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_069bb2f77c800660f735",
   "sourceHash": "069bb2f77c800660f73558db64b7e68213443be057d2fe268f68ebf9596afd9c",
   "text": "练习舒缓瑜伽或调息。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c28a60a0132cb1a8a0d5",
   "sourceHash": "c28a60a0132cb1a8a0d5c71e2a492ad48170da2477e3fe355e63e903ee4259a9",
   "text": "参加引导式冥想或正念课程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5fb1788671ee4254f6d3",
   "sourceHash": "5fb1788671ee4254f6d3865ae5dba417bf1a63edf03e062977768ec11c5bdd4d",
   "text": "以轻柔的伸展或温热的草本浴结束一天。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce238c0f87d108dcd0bd",
   "sourceHash": "ce238c0f87d108dcd0bdcdcaa1622eeb0aa8a4d8143ce098bed3bc313da7159d",
   "text": "为夜晚做好准备，然后就寝。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_93b8ae99d9ccf3aa4ba8",
   "sourceHash": "93b8ae99d9ccf3aa4ba843b0f747a65ff5ef3058e1b0c75bd5a08302eb7d44f6",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]][[OPEN_2]]简介[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]↓[[CLOSE_3]][[CLOSE_1]] [[OPEN_4]][[OPEN_5]]历史[[CLOSE_5]][[OPEN_6]]↓[[CLOSE_6]][[CLOSE_4]] [[OPEN_7]][[OPEN_8]]流程[[CLOSE_8]][[OPEN_9]]↓[[CLOSE_9]][[CLOSE_7]] [[OPEN_10]][[OPEN_11]]特色[[CLOSE_11]][[OPEN_12]]↓[[CLOSE_12]][[CLOSE_10]] [[OPEN_13]][[OPEN_14]]评价[[CLOSE_14]][[OPEN_15]]↓[[CLOSE_15]][[CLOSE_13]] [[OPEN_16]][[OPEN_17]]套餐价格[[CLOSE_17]][[OPEN_18]]↓[[CLOSE_18]][[CLOSE_16]] [[OPEN_19]][[OPEN_20]]常见问题[[CLOSE_20]][[OPEN_21]]↓[[CLOSE_21]][[CLOSE_19]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5ad5bb9af51f555aa351",
   "sourceHash": "5ad5bb9af51f555aa351802183f233740cde0c57495ae61883ed2df201b0d521",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]首页[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]/[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]全部治疗方案[[CLOSE_3]][[OPEN_4]]/[[CLOSE_4]][[OPEN_5]]瑜伽与冥想[[CLOSE_5]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f8894d3fa61e14e3a1cb",
   "sourceHash": "f8894d3fa61e14e3a1cbe1061038722dc7c9ef0d61eff592af4904f321adb8e2",
   "text": "瑜伽与冥想方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Used 方案 rather than the term 治疗方案 here to avoid presenting yoga/meditation as medical treatment."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ba8000dd4cb54e4dd19a",
   "sourceHash": "ba8000dd4cb54e4dd19ad2d2f33387308be55bbdff721f896040cb97614ad74e",
   "text": "通过我们的瑜伽与冥想方案体验深度放松。在疗愈村恢复身心平衡、增进健康，让身心重焕活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Used 方案 rather than 治疗方案 for yoga/meditation programmes to avoid implying medical treatment."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f3a1227e14e09f449adb",
   "sourceHash": "f3a1227e14e09f449adb6492b89cab818c7e4cf7d7ef44b7fc87998e4408e553",
   "text": "通过我们的瑜伽与冥想方案体验深度放松。在我们位于喀拉拉邦的静修之所恢复身心平衡、增进健康，让身心重焕活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f912b22fb1403fde48e",
   "sourceHash": "6f912b22fb1403fde48eea1f7d411a0d88c7e3ebf0add8051a085f2abd87ed19",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]首页[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]/[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]全部治疗方案[[CLOSE_3]][[OPEN_4]]/[[CLOSE_4]][[OPEN_5]]Yoga–Dhyāna Abhyāsa — 瑜伽与冥想培训[[CLOSE_5]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_37689a8d314ad67f3c23",
   "sourceHash": "37689a8d314ad67f3c23a429d4b0df05ffd1fb988df4d4b322164d6a0adbcd45",
   "text": "在 Kairali 位于喀拉拉邦的静修之所，住院式瑜伽与冥想培训与阿育吠陀相结合，课程根据参与者的经验进行调整。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c7f4bfd845337f35d729",
   "sourceHash": "c7f4bfd845337f35d72994bb7a84fbd5c9fbc87b1b26185a8d1799c958e013f2",
   "text": "关于[[OPEN_1]]Yoga–Dhyāna Abhyāsa — 瑜伽与冥想培训[[CLOSE_1]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b92669f151a47a83e0e5",
   "sourceHash": "b92669f151a47a83e0e5d2c04e98e21f1e4ec1dab1ff471c3f7c2c22d6b9f297",
   "text": "在 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村，Yoga–Dhyāna Abhyāsa — 瑜伽与冥想培训在住院式静修环境中，将引导式瑜伽与冥想课程与阿育吠陀相结合。本方案适合不同经验水平的参与者。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
